{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Lake\n🌊 A Hometown location that was practically decorative until Ch.5 (June 24, 2026).","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"3"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Lake.png","x":-640,"y":-105,"width":220,"height":165},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Dess**\nTheory that Dess might still be alive near the Lake, since it's the central setting of Ch.5 and an area where the Roaring Knight has emerged before.","x":-130,"y":-640,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Noelle**\nThe setting for two key moments for her: the date with Susie on the normal route, and the submersion scene with Kris on the Weird Route.","x":420,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Onionsan**\nA recurring Lake NPC who disappears starting in Ch.4, right when the Normal NPC starts appearing in their place.","x":420,"y":220,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Routes**\nThe Weird Route's exclusive Ch.5 ending is only accessible after accumulating enough hidden choices in previous chapters.","x":-130,"y":480,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**What lies beneath the surface?**\nThe series' biggest loose end to date: it's unknown exactly what \"Ch.7, Side B\" represents, whether there's a Dark Fountain hidden underwater, or how this connects to Dess's disappearance.","x":-680,"y":220,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"1"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Dess.png","x":-130,"y":-850,"width":86,"height":180},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Noelle_overworld.png","x":420,"y":-470,"width":90,"height":180},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Deltarune_-_Sprite_-_Onionsan_-_Kawaii.webp","x":420,"y":10,"width":183,"height":180},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/routes.png","x":-130,"y":270,"width":180,"height":180},{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"**Kris**\nHe's the one Noelle drags into the water — and who, according to her, \"changed\" after Dess's disappearance.","x":-130,"y":880,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"4"},{"id":"s5-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Kris_overworld_static.png","x":-130,"y":690,"width":180,"height":109},{"id":"s6","type":"text","text":"**Normal NPC**\nOccupies the exact same spot where Onionsan used to be, with a speech pattern that eerily matches theirs.","x":210,"y":880,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"4"},{"id":"s6-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Deltarune_-_Sprite_-_Normal_NPC.webp","x":210,"y":690,"width":148,"height":170},{"id":"s8","type":"text","text":"**\"Further and further, grayer and grayer\"**\nEach press of \"Continue\" briefly resets the colors before they saturate again, giving the sense of going further and further, and grayer and grayer.","x":890,"y":880,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"3"},{"id":"s9","type":"text","text":"**Rudy**\nIt's by the Lake that Noelle gets the call about his fall at the Festival — consistent with him himself \"falling\" at the end of Ch.5.","x":760,"y":-260,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"4"},{"id":"s9-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Rudy_Overworld_1.png","x":760,"y":-450,"width":84,"height":170},{"id":"s10","type":"text","text":"**Gerson Boom**\n\"Can you hear their song, singing from the depths?\" [TODO: verify exact EN quote] — the centerpiece of the theory about the song that comes from afar.","x":-130,"y":160,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"3"},{"id":"s10-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Hammer_of_Justice_battle_idle.gif","x":-130,"y":-30,"width":180,"height":131},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/lake_noelle_and_kriss_drowning.png","x":-935,"y":435,"width":190,"height":170}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s3","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"e4_x0","fromNode":"s4","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s2-img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s3-img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s5","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s5-img","fromNode":"s5-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s6","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s6","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s6-img","fromNode":"s6-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s6","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s8","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s8","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s9","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s9","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s9-img","fromNode":"s9-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s9","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s10","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s10","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s10-img","fromNode":"s10-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s10","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s4-img","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"1"}]}